+## Key Design Decisions
+
+- **2Q preview-cache replacement.** The preview worker separates first-use and repeatedly used contact sheets so long sequential screenings do not displace comparison sheets. LRU was rejected because scans can evict reused sheets; frequency-based eviction with aging was rejected because counter maintenance and stale popularity retention add complexity without preserving project-switch responsiveness.
